How much observed clock step we are willing to accept before we panic.
.SS connect_timeout
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Units: seconds
.IP \(bu 2
Default: 3.500
.IP \(bu 2
Minimum: 0.000
.IP \(bu 2
Flags: timeout
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
