How many parked request we start for each completed request on the object.
NB: Even with the implicit delay of delivery, this parameter controls an exponential increase in number of worker threads. A value of 1 will instead serialize requests resumption and is only useful for testing purposes.
.SS send_timeout
.INDENT 0.0
